      "content": "i guess. it's just harder than that. it's like they're all living in this bright, loud world and i'm just stuck in the gray. i look at people laughing in cafes or worrying about stupid things and it feels like they're on a different planet. like i'm already gone, and i'm just waiting for my body to realize it too.",
